flowchart TD
    A[Identify stakeholders and potential users] --> B[Recruit interview participants]
    B --> C[Design and review questions with UX]
    C --> D[Conduct interviews<br/>BA facilitates · UX takes notes]
    D --> E[Consolidate and categorise findings]
    E --> F[Present insights to the platform team]
    F --> G[Use findings to inform story mapping]

    classDef step fill:#EDF4FC,stroke:#3466A0,color:#14283F,stroke-width:1.4px;
    classDef outcome fill:#E2F2E8,stroke:#328359,color:#153F2B,stroke-width:1.8px;
    class A,B,C,D,E,F step;
    class G outcome;
